The board component models under assets/voltworks/models/component (except
the transistor, resistor and capacitor models), the circuit design table model,
the language strings and the recipes under data/voltworks/recipe that follow
Power Grid's recipes are taken from Create: Power Grid under the same license,
with resource locations changed to the voltworks namespace.

Most block and item textures under assets/voltworks/textures (including
block/component, block/modular_display, the circuit board, circuit design
table, acid, power plug and wire connector textures, and the item icons that
have a Power Grid counterpart) and the circuit board, circuit design table and
wire connector models are taken unmodified from Create: Power Grid under the
same license, with resource locations changed to the voltworks namespace.
The GUI textures, the dyed circuit board variants and the remaining item
textures without a Power Grid counterpart are original work for CEE: Voltworks.

The battery (io.github.sjzeero.voltworks.battery) is derived from Create: Power
Grid's battery block (powergrid:battery): its voltage, internal resistance,
capacity and comparator curves and its rules for joining batteries into banks
follow Power Grid, modified for Voltworks (rectangular banks, Electro
Energetics terminals, recharging from empty). Its side and end textures are
adapted from Power Grid's battery textures (the insulator strips recoloured
into a charge gauge, end tiles for one-block-wide banks composed from Power
Grid's tiles); the terminal posts and block models are original work for
CEE: Voltworks.

